+- **Check:** `test_nvn_timing.py` exercises the pure-C accounting with synthetic timing, including overlapping per-key intervals, invalid counters, the runtime snapshot wiring and all TSV rows. This adds attribution, not a frame-rate fix.
+- **Found on:** the [Odyssey iPad audit](../../dm/games/0100000000010000/README.md#found-on-this-game). Earlier captures cannot be retroactively tagged; new `shader prefetch` lines include their frame, and new TSV captures can match batch wall time to individual frames.
