+- **Found on:** upstream Breath of the Wild; the same faulty paths are present in the [Odyssey iPad host audit](../../dm/games/0100000000010000/README.md#found-on-this-game). No Odyssey frame-time gain or bloom correction is established. Compare the same route and partial-shadow refusal counters; keep expensive `DM_NVN_UBP_CHECK` validation separate from performance runs.
